      "content": "idk, the silence you're talking about sounds more like just... non-existence. like everything is just gone. and honestly, that sounds almost better than this. sometimes i feel like the only way to actually get that peace, to finally stop the noise and the pretending, is to just totally disappear. like, not just from social media or whatever, but to actually just cease to be. does that even make sense? like, why is it so wrong to want that much quiet?",
